{"ID":"20250918110959-d7s76hw","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250918110959-d7s76hw","title":"UPL5-10——复杂计算结果缓存","type":"doc","updated":"20250918111542"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918110959-7u2e4a0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918110959-7u2e4a0","updated":"20250918111045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复杂计算结果缓存"}]},{"ID":"20250918111035-ab232n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111035-ab232n9","updated":"20250918111045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复杂计算结果缓存指的是避免重复执行开销大的运算，将结果缓存起来复用，从而减少 CPU 运算量和时间消耗\n这类优化尤其适用于 频繁执行但变化不频繁 的逻辑"}]},{"ID":"20250918111023-uffgvss","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918111023-uffgvss","updated":"20250918111542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常会缓存的计算结果"}]},{"ID":"20250918111050-ygo12b2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918111050-ygo12b2","updated":"20250918111542"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918111134-3epilzj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-3epilzj","updated":"20250918111437"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918111134-cxfkgur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-cxfkgur","updated":"20250918111134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数学计算结果缓存"}]},{"ID":"20250918111135-na367rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111135-na367rt","updated":"20250918111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们可以在初始化项目基础数据时，把各种数据提前算好\n以三角函数为例，我们可以用一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"float"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 数组存储 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0~359"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 度所有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Sin"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Cos"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等等三角函数值"}]},{"ID":"20250918111402-o4b31y5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250918111402-o4b31y5","updated":"20250918111437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"float[] allSin = new float[360];\nfor (int i = 0; i \u003c 360; i++)\n{\n    allSin[i] = Mathf.Sin(i * Mathf.Deg2Rad);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918111134-2bhkf9x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-2bhkf9x","updated":"20250918111542"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918111134-n69mwwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-n69mwwz","updated":"20250918111134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寻路计算结果缓存"}]},{"ID":"20250918111153-b0mbxu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111153-b0mbxu7","updated":"20250918111542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果项目中存在 A* 寻路等寻路算法，可以用容器缓存两个点之间的路径，\n下次寻路时，发现存在已寻路点，直接获取路径来使用"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918111134-rx08rln","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-rx08rln","updated":"20250918111134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918111134-nvqwge7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-nvqwge7","updated":"20250918111134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静态配置数据缓存"}]},{"ID":"20250918111158-jyes971","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111158-jyes971","updated":"20250918111158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于配置表中数据，特别是需要频繁使用的表，我们应该在进入游戏时就反序列化后存储在内存中\n避免每次使用配置数据，都重复反序列化"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918111134-zeqekis","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-zeqekis","updated":"20250918111134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918111134-kzbhzcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-kzbhzcs","updated":"20250918111134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理投射数据缓存"}]},{"ID":"20250918111200-lqzgo18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111200-lqzgo18","updated":"20250918111220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理投射指的是用虚拟形状去探测物体之间的空间关系，常用于碰撞、视野、攻击等逻辑判断\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Unity"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中的射线检测、范围检测等相关 API 都属于物理投射 API\n如果在位置、范围、相对坐标都不变的情况下，如果存在经常复用，也可以将其结果缓存下来，避免每次重复计算"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918111134-426t93w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-426t93w","updated":"20250918111134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918111134-lxbek5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111134-lxbek5c","updated":"20250918111226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 参数的缓存"}]},{"ID":"20250918111228-lufymbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111228-lufymbv","updated":"20250918111246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该避免频繁重复设置 Shader 属性、提升 CPU 到 GPU 的通讯效率\n比如：在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中每帧设置 Shader 参数 ："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mat.SetFloat(\"_Speed\", 5.0f);"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n我们可以在 C# 中将数据缓存下来，当真正发生变化时再传递给着色器进行处理"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918111114-pdsoiu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918111114-pdsoiu2","updated":"20250918111114"}}]}